  "raw": "---\nphase: \"01\"\nphase_name: identity-slice\nproject: Dense Fixture Project\ngenerated: 2026-06-10\ncounts:\n  decisions: 1\n  lessons: 1\n  patterns: 1\n  surprises: 0\nmissing_artifacts: []\n---\n\n# Phase 1 Learnings: Identity Slice\n\n## Decisions\n\n- Every unfamiliar artifact type is authored from its own `gsd-core` template (D-01).\n\n## Lessons\n\n1. A phase directory can legitimately hold both templated artifact types (`SPEC.md`) and a genuinely\n   invented one (`01-COST-MODEL.md`) side by side.\n\n## Patterns\n\n- Registry-dispatched artifact handlers with an unconditional generic handler always last.\n\n## Surprises\n\nNone.\n"
